<title>USA: Atlantic Express Transporation Q2 full results.</title>
<headline>Atlantic Express Transporation Q2 full results.</headline>
<dateline>STATEN ISLAND, N.Y. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					 Dec. 31		Dec. 31</p>
<p>				   1996	  1995    1996	1995</p>
<p>						  (amounts in millions)</p>
<p> Revenue			 $45.0	$40.7   $70.2     $59.6</p>
<p> Total Cost of Sales	  36.8	 31.3    59.7	48.6</p>
<p>   Gross Profit		  8.2	  9.4    10.5	11.0</p>
<p> Total G&amp;A			 3.1	  2.9     5.6	 5.1</p>
<p> EBITDA(1)			 5.2	  6.4     5.0	 5.9</p>
<p>Depreciation and</p>
<p>  Amortization		   2.8	  2.6     5.4	 4.9</p>
<p>Income (Loss) from</p>
<p>  Operations		     2.4	  3.8   (0.4)	 1.0</p>
<p>Net Interest Expense</p>
<p>  (Income)			 1.7	  1.3     3.1	 2.3</p>
<p> Earnings Before Taxes	 0.7	  2.6   (3.5)     (1.3)</p>
<p>Income Tax Provision</p>
<p>  (Benefit)			0.3	  0.9   (1.4)     (0.5)</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)	     0.4	  1.5   (2.1)     (0.8)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company's full name is Atlantic Express Transporation Corp.</p>
<p>(1) EBITDA represents income (loss) from operations before depreciation and amortization.</p>
<p>On Jan. 30, 1997, the company completed a private placement of $110,000,000 aggregate principal amount 10 3/4% Senior Secured Notes due 2004.</p>
</text>
